     "body": "<p><span class=\"error\">&#91;Followup from Sourceforge Tracker&#93;</span><br/>\nFollowup Submitter: cwilper<br/>\nLogged In: YES <br/>\nuser_id=189298<br/>\nOriginator: YES</p>\n\n<p>The problem appears to be related to the existence check for the \"do\" table.  It may relate to UPPERCASE vs. lowercase table name conventions for difference databases (and configurations).</p>\n\n<p>This has been addressed in documentation:</p>\n\n<p>There now exists a new up-front step to the migration process.  It instructs the user to manually rename the \"do\" table to \"dobj\" before starting the installer.</p>",
